  "reviews": {
    "text": "Members mention two things most often: that the instructor actually corrects them during the session, and that lower-back pain eases sooner than they expected.",
    "items": [
      {
        "title": "My back no longer aches after a desk day",
        "text": "After two months of twice-weekly sessions I sat through a full working day pain-free for the first time. The assessment showed the problem was tight hip flexors rather than my back — something nobody had told me before.",
